  "reason": "Image evidence is sparse: the only image experiment so far, config_010 with resnet50 singleprofile, is weak (0.208 accuracy), so it is unclear whether the image modality lacks useful signal or whether the image encoder is simply too weak. config_013 tests this by replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l while keeping singleprofile and no fusion, isolating the effect of image representation. This is the best next experiment under a limited budget because it gives a clean comparison to config_010 and determines whether a stronger image encoder is worth adding to multimodal fusion before spending budget on more complex multiprofile or fused configurations."
}

